     The wwaattcchhddoogg utility can be used to control the kernel's watchdog facil‐
     ity.

     The --dd option enables debugging.

     The --tt _t_i_m_e_o_u_t option specifies the desired timeout period in seconds, a
     value of zero will disable the watchdog.  The default timeout is 128 sec‐
     onds.

